<title>AUSTRALIA: MOTOR RACING-AUSTRALIAN GRAND PRIX PRACTICE TIMES.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-AUSTRALIAN GRAND PRIX PRACTICE TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
